Error [E2912]: `reactive.derived` must compute and return a value
  --> tests/ui/reactive_derived_returns_nothing.jet:5:27
    |
  5 |     d := reactive.derived(() => {
    |                           ^^^^^^^
 Why: a derived value is recomputed from its signals; its lambda has to return the value
 Fix: return a value from the body, or use `reactive.effect(() => { … })` for a side effect
